10. USE CASE SCENARIOS
    └── DATA_USER_EN = 0 appropriate for:
        ├── Basic cache functionality without metadata
        ├── Memory-constrained systems
        ├── Performance-critical applications
        └── Systems without user data requirements

    └── DATA_USER_EN = 1 would be used for:
        ├── Cache coherency protocols requiring metadata
