KEY RELATIONSHIPS:
- DataUserEn = 0 disables AXI user signal generation and storage
- Reduces cache memory overhead by eliminating user data storage
- Simplifies cache controller logic and AXI interface
- AXI_USER_EN combines DataUserEn and FetchUserEn flags
- Suitable for basic cache functionality without metadata requirements